[{"id":"part-height","title":"都保持有序，为什么查找代价不同？","section":"height","role":"section","body":"","goal":"由正确性转向结构形态与计算代价","activity":"小节转折","withheld_results":[]},{"id":"build-shape-balanced","title":"同一集合：顺序A怎样生成树形？","section":"height","role":"content","body":"<div class=\"d017\"><p class=\"d17-lead\">先清空旧树。按照30、20、44、16、27、36、55依次插入，得到以下普通BST。</p><div class=\"d17-cols\"><div class=\"d17-panel\"><h3>重新构造的树A</h3><svg class=\"d17-tree\" viewBox=\"0 0 540 350\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"T0\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><line x1=\"270\" y1=\"45\" x2=\"140\" y2=\"132\" stroke=\"#7994ad\" stroke-width=\"3\"/><line x1=\"270\" y1=\"45\" x2=\"408\" y2=\"132\" stroke=\"#7994ad\" stroke-width=\"3\"/><line x1=\"140\" y1=\"132\" x2=\"70\" y2=\"245\" stroke=\"#7994ad\" stroke-width=\"3\"/><line x1=\"140\" y1=\"132\" x2=\"215\" y2=\"245\" stroke=\"#7994ad\" stroke-width=\"3\"/><line x1=\"408\" y1=\"132\" x2=\"345\" y2=\"245\" stroke=\"#7994ad\" stroke-width=\"3\"/><line x1=\"408\" y1=\"132\" x2=\"478\" y2=\"245\" stroke=\"#7994ad\" stroke-width=\"3\"/><circle cx=\"270\" cy=\"45\" r=\"26\" fill=\"white\" stroke=\"#7998b1\" stroke-width=\"2.4\"/><text x=\"270\" y=\"53\" font-size=\"25\" font-weight=\"700\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#193f60\">30</text><circle cx=\"140\" cy=\"132\" r=\"26\" fill=\"white\" stroke=\"#7998b1\" stroke-width=\"2.4\"/><text x=\"140\" y=\"140\" font-size=\"25\" font-weight=\"700\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#193f60\">20</text><circle cx=\"408\" cy=\"132\" r=\"26\" fill=\"white\" stroke=\"#7998b1\" stroke-width=\"2.4\"/><text x=\"408\" y=\"140\" font-size=\"25\" font-weight=\"700\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#193f60\">44</text><circle cx=\"70\" cy=\"245\" r=\"26\" fill=\"white\" stroke=\"#7998b1\" stroke-width=\"2.4\"/><text x=\"70\" y=\"253\" font-size=\"25\" font-weight=\"700\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#193f60\">16</text><circle cx=\"215\" cy=\"245\" r=\"26\" fill=\"white\" stroke=\"#7998b1\" stroke-width=\"2.4\"/><text x=\"215\" y=\"253\" font-size=\"25\" font-weight=\"700\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#193f60\">27</text><circle cx=\"345\" cy=\"245\" r=\"26\" fill=\"white\" stroke=\"#7998b1\" stroke-width=\"2.4\"/><text x=\"345\" y=\"253\" font-size=\"25\" font-weight=\"700\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#193f60\">36</text><circle cx=\"478\" cy=\"245\" r=\"26\" fill=\"white\" stroke=\"#7998b1\" stroke-width=\"2.4\"/><text x=\"478\" y=\"253\" font-size=\"25\" font-weight=\"700\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#193f60\">55</text></svg><p class=\"d17-note\">根30，层数计树高3；这是普通BST，不是经过平衡旋转的结果。</p></div><div class=\"d17-panel\"><h3>插入顺序影响当前形态</h3><div class=\"d17-steps\"><div class=\"d17-step\"><b>先插30</b>它成为根</div><div class=\"d17-step\"><b>再插20、44</b>分别形成左右子树</div><div class=\"d17-step\"><b>最后四个数</b>扩展出第三层的叶子</div></div><p class=\"d17-note\">换一组插入顺序时，必须重新从空树构造；不能继承删除后的T2。</p></div></div></div>","goal":"明确从空树构造时插入顺序决定BST形态","activity":"具体顺序的构造过程","withheld_results":[]},{"id":"build-shape-chain","title":"若按升序插入，树会形成什么形态？","section":"height","role":"content","body":"<div class=\"d017\"><p class=\"d17-lead\">重新从空树开始，使用完全相同的七个关键字：16、20、27、30、36、44、55。</p><div class=\"d17-cols\"><div class=\"d17-panel\"><h3>升序构造的树B</h3><svg class=\"d17-tree long\" viewBox=\"0 0 540 430\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"chain\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><line x1=\"72\" y1=\"44\" x2=\"132\" y2=\"100\" stroke=\"#7994ad\" stroke-width=\"3\"/><line x1=\"132\" y1=\"100\" x2=\"192\" y2=\"156\" stroke=\"#7994ad\" stroke-width=\"3\"/><line x1=\"192\" y1=\"156\" x2=\"252\" y2=\"212\" stroke=\"#7994ad\" stroke-width=\"3\"/><line x1=\"252\" y1=\"212\" x2=\"312\" y2=\"268\" stroke=\"#7994ad\" stroke-width=\"3\"/><line x1=\"312\" y1=\"268\" x2=\"372\" y2=\"324\" stroke=\"#7994ad\" stroke-width=\"3\"/><line x1=\"372\" y1=\"324\" x2=\"432\" y2=\"380\" stroke=\"#7994ad\" stroke-width=\"3\"/><circle cx=\"72\" cy=\"44\" r=\"26\" fill=\"white\" stroke=\"#7998b1\" stroke-width=\"2.4\"/><text x=\"72\" y=\"52\" font-size=\"25\" font-weight=\"700\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#193f60\">16</text><circle cx=\"132\" cy=\"100\" r=\"26\" fill=\"white\" stroke=\"#7998b1\" stroke-width=\"2.4\"/><text x=\"132\" y=\"108\" font-size=\"25\" font-weight=\"700\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#193f60\">20</text><circle cx=\"192\" cy=\"156\" r=\"26\" fill=\"white\" stroke=\"#7998b1\" stroke-width=\"2.4\"/><text x=\"192\" y=\"164\" font-size=\"25\" font-weight=\"700\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#193f60\">27</text><circle cx=\"252\" cy=\"212\" r=\"26\" fill=\"white\" stroke=\"#7998b1\" stroke-width=\"2.4\"/><text x=\"252\" y=\"220\" font-size=\"25\" font-weight=\"700\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#193f60\">30</text><circle cx=\"312\" cy=\"268\" r=\"26\" fill=\"white\" stroke=\"#7998b1\" stroke-width=\"2.4\"/><text x=\"312\" y=\"276\" font-size=\"25\" font-weight=\"700\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#193f60\">36</text><circle cx=\"372\" cy=\"324\" r=\"26\" fill=\"white\" stroke=\"#7998b1\" stroke-width=\"2.4\"/><text x=\"372\" y=\"332\" font-size=\"25\" font-weight=\"700\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#193f60\">44</text><circle cx=\"432\" cy=\"380\" r=\"26\" fill=\"white\" stroke=\"#7998b1\" stroke-width=\"2.4\"/><text x=\"432\" y=\"388\" font-size=\"25\" font-weight=\"700\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#193f60\">55</text></svg><p class=\"d17-note\">每次搜索走向右边，最后形成高7的右单支树。</p></div><div class=\"d17-panel\"><h3>形态为什么不同？</h3><div class=\"d17-steps\"><div class=\"d17-step\"><b>根16</b>首个插入</div><div class=\"d17-step\"><b>20、27、30…</b>后来的数都大于已访问结点</div><div class=\"d17-step\"><b>最后55</b>落到第七层</div></div><p class=\"d17-note\">顺序性质仍正确，但没有维护高度的操作来阻止退化。</p></div></div></div>","goal":"看见相同关键字集合升序插入后的高度退化","activity":"对照新构造形态","withheld_results":[]},{"id":"compare-path","title":"查找55：两棵树各访问多少个结点？","section":"height","role":"exercise","body":"<div class=\"d017\"><div class=\"course-workspace d17-workspace course-workspace-stacked\" data-course-component=\"task-workspace\"><div class=\"course-input\" data-task-input><div class=\"d17-cols\"><div class=\"d17-panel\"><h3>树A：重新从空树构造</h3><svg class=\"d17-tree\" viewBox=\"0 0 540 350\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"T0\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><line x1=\"270\" y1=\"45\" x2=\"140\" y2=\"132\" stroke=\"#7994ad\" stroke-width=\"3\"/><line x1=\"270\" y1=\"45\" x2=\"408\" y2=\"132\" stroke=\"#7994ad\" stroke-width=\"3\"/><line x1=\"140\" y1=\"132\" x2=\"70\" y2=\"245\" stroke=\"#7994ad\" stroke-width=\"3\"/><line x1=\"140\" y1=\"132\" x2=\"215\" y2=\"245\" stroke=\"#7994ad\" stroke-width=\"3\"/><line x1=\"408\" y1=\"132\" x2=\"345\" y2=\"245\" stroke=\"#7994ad\" stroke-width=\"3\"/><line x1=\"408\" y1=\"132\" x2=\"478\" y2=\"245\" stroke=\"#7994ad\" stroke-width=\"3\"/><circle cx=\"270\" cy=\"45\" r=\"26\" fill=\"white\" stroke=\"#7998b1\" stroke-width=\"2.4\"/><text x=\"270\" y=\"53\" font-size=\"25\" font-weight=\"700\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#193f60\">30</text><circle cx=\"140\" cy=\"132\" r=\"26\" fill=\"white\" stroke=\"#7998b1\" stroke-width=\"2.4\"/><text x=\"140\" y=\"140\" font-size=\"25\" font-weight=\"700\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#193f60\">20</text><circle cx=\"408\" cy=\"132\" r=\"26\" fill=\"white\" stroke=\"#7998b1\" stroke-width=\"2.4\"/><text x=\"408\" y=\"140\" font-size=\"25\" font-weight=\"700\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#193f60\">44</text><circle cx=\"70\" cy=\"245\" r=\"26\" fill=\"white\" stroke=\"#7998b1\" stroke-width=\"2.4\"/><text x=\"70\" y=\"253\" font-size=\"25\" font-weight=\"700\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#193f60\">16</text><circle cx=\"215\" cy=\"245\" r=\"26\" fill=\"white\" stroke=\"#7998b1\" stroke-width=\"2.4\"/><text x=\"215\" y=\"253\" font-size=\"25\" font-weight=\"700\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#193f60\">27</text><circle cx=\"345\" cy=\"245\" r=\"26\" fill=\"white\" stroke=\"#7998b1\" stroke-width=\"2.4\"/><text x=\"345\" y=\"253\" font-size=\"25\" font-weight=\"700\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#193f60\">36</text><circle cx=\"478\" cy=\"245\" r=\"26\" fill=\"white\" stroke=\"#7998b1\" stroke-width=\"2.4\"/><text x=\"478\" y=\"253\" font-size=\"25\" font-weight=\"700\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#193f60\">55</text></svg><p class=\"d17-note\">不是T2，根30。</p></div><div class=\"d17-panel\"><h3>树B：从空树升序构造</h3><svg class=\"d17-tree long\" viewBox=\"0 0 540 430\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"chain\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><line x1=\"72\" y1=\"44\" x2=\"132\" y2=\"100\" stroke=\"#7994ad\" stroke-width=\"3\"/><line x1=\"132\" y1=\"100\" x2=\"192\" y2=\"156\" stroke=\"#7994ad\" stroke-width=\"3\"/><line x1=\"192\" y1=\"156\" x2=\"252\" y2=\"212\" stroke=\"#7994ad\" stroke-width=\"3\"/><line x1=\"252\" y1=\"212\" x2=\"312\" y2=\"268\" stroke=\"#7994ad\" stroke-width=\"3\"/><line x1=\"312\" y1=\"268\" x2=\"372\" y2=\"324\" stroke=\"#7994ad\" stroke-width=\"3\"/><line x1=\"372\" y1=\"324\" x2=\"432\" y2=\"380\" stroke=\"#7994ad\" stroke-width=\"3\"/><circle cx=\"72\" cy=\"44\" r=\"26\" fill=\"white\" stroke=\"#7998b1\" stroke-width=\"2.4\"/><text x=\"72\" y=\"52\" font-size=\"25\" font-weight=\"700\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#193f60\">16</text><circle cx=\"132\" cy=\"100\" r=\"26\" fill=\"white\" stroke=\"#7998b1\" stroke-width=\"2.4\"/><text x=\"132\" y=\"108\" font-size=\"25\" font-weight=\"700\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#193f60\">20</text><circle cx=\"192\" cy=\"156\" r=\"26\" fill=\"white\" stroke=\"#7998b1\" stroke-width=\"2.4\"/><text x=\"192\" y=\"164\" font-size=\"25\" font-weight=\"700\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#193f60\">27</text><circle cx=\"252\" cy=\"212\" r=\"26\" fill=\"white\" stroke=\"#7998b1\" stroke-width=\"2.4\"/><text x=\"252\" y=\"220\" font-size=\"25\" font-weight=\"700\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#193f60\">30</text><circle cx=\"312\" cy=\"268\" r=\"26\" fill=\"white\" stroke=\"#7998b1\" stroke-width=\"2.4\"/><text x=\"312\" y=\"276\" font-size=\"25\" font-weight=\"700\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#193f60\">36</text><circle cx=\"372\" cy=\"324\" r=\"26\" fill=\"white\" stroke=\"#7998b1\" stroke-width=\"2.4\"/><text x=\"372\" y=\"332\" font-size=\"25\" font-weight=\"700\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#193f60\">44</text><circle cx=\"432\" cy=\"380\" r=\"26\" fill=\"white\" stroke=\"#7998b1\" stroke-width=\"2.4\"/><text x=\"432\" y=\"388\" font-size=\"25\" font-weight=\"700\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#193f60\">55</text></svg><p class=\"d17-note\">根16，右单支。</p></div></div></div><div class=\"course-task\"><div class=\"course-prompt\" data-task-prompt><div class=\"d17-question\">两树都查找55。请画访问路径、数出访问结点数，并给出树高。</div></div><details class=\"course-answer\" data-task-answer><summary>核对答案与理由</summary><div class=\"course-solution\"><p>树A的访问路径为30→44→55，访问<b>3</b>个非空结点，高3。</p><p>树B依次访问16、20、27、30、36、44、55，共<b>7</b>个结点，高7。</p><p>两棵树均符合BST顺序性质，但查询代价不同。</p></div></details></div></div></div>","goal":"通过具体查找路径量化高度与访问次数","activity":"独立预测并核对","withheld_results":["访问3和7"]},{"id":"worst-shape","title":"规模n增加，最坏路径会有多长？","section":"height","role":"content","body":"<div class=\"d017\"><p class=\"d17-lead\">普通BST的一次查找或沿路径插入、删除，需要经过的结点数受树高h影响。</p><div class=\"d17-steps\"><div class=\"d17-step\"><b>结构决定高度h</b>实际遍历沿根到某结点的单条路径</div><div class=\"d17-step\"><b>一般工作量</b>O(h)</div><div class=\"d17-step\"><b>最坏单支形态</b>h=n，因而最坏O(n)</div></div><div class=\"d17-formula\">BST顺序正确 ≠ 树高必为 O(log n)</div><p class=\"d17-note\">平均情况需要结合输入顺序和查询分布，不能从较矮的主例直接推出最坏对数保证。</p></div>","goal":"区分BST的O(h)条件与最坏O(n)结论","activity":"从个案推广到一般n","withheld_results":[]},{"id":"need-balance","title":"顺序已经保证，怎样再控制最长路径？","section":"height","role":"content","body":"<div class=\"d017\"><div class=\"d17-cols\"><div class=\"d17-panel\"><h3>已经掌握的正确性依据</h3><div class=\"d17-question\">每个结点：左子树更小，右子树更大。</div><p class=\"d17-note\">保证查找、插入等操作的比较方向。</p></div><div class=\"d17-panel\"><h3>还缺少的代价保证</h3><div class=\"d17-question\">树高可能达到n，最长路径也可能线性增长。</div><p class=\"d17-note\">能否增加一种可以在更新后恢复的结构条件？</p></div></div><p class=\"d17-lead\">下一阶段：从局部子树的高度差入手，研究动态维护。</p></div>","goal":"提出可维护局部高度条件作为新的设计需求","activity":"从缺口提出新约束","withheld_results":[]}]